  "html": "<div class=\"stirling_container\">\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><a class=\"Button stir_home_teal\" title=\"About this module\" href=\"https://buv.instructure.com/courses/7272/pages/about-this-module\" data-course-type=\"wikiPages\" data-published=\"true\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://buv.instructure.com/api/v1/courses/7272/pages/about-this-module\" data-api-returntype=\"Page\">About this module</a> <a class=\"Button stir_home_blue\" title=\"Syllabus\" href=\"https://buv.instructure.com/courses/7272/assignments/syllabus\" data-course-type=\"navigation\">Syllabus</a> <a class=\"Button stir_home_berry\" title=\"Units\" href=\"https://buv.instructure.com/courses/7272/modules\" data-course-type=\"navigation\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://buv.instructure.com/api/v1/courses/7272/modules\" data-api-returntype=\"[Module]\">Units</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://buv.instructure.com/courses/7272/files/813807/preview?hidden=1&amp;verifier=025ec718-31c1-4cec-b6c1-f0d15e1f79df\" alt=\"Welcome to your module\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://buv.instructure.com/api/v1/courses/7272/files/813807\" data-api-returntype=\"File\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Announcements</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>21 Sep: first lecture at 2pm in V1.</span></li>\n<li>This module covers selective topics in mathematics that are highly relevant to computing science, further study of mathematics and life in general. We will have a mixture of lectures and tutorial sessions to help you engage with and understand the content.&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><img id=\"5160237\" src=\"https://buv.instructure.com/courses/7272/files/813737/preview?verifier=213774d5-761a-4aba-a960-56ca71e9669c\" alt=\"Get Started\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://buv.instructure.com/api/v1/courses/7272/files/813737\" data-api-returntype=\"File\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\n<div class=\"pad-box-mini border border-trbl berry_border\">\n<p style=\"margin-left: 15px;\">To get you started, make sure you familiarise yourself with some key areas in this module. For example, <a title=\"Syllabus\" href=\"https://buv.instructure.com/courses/7272/assignments/syllabus\" data-course-type=\"navigation\"><strong>Syllabus</strong></a> is where you can find key dates and a module outline. <a title=\"Units\" href=\"https://buv.instructure.com/courses/7272/modules\" data-course-type=\"navigation\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://buv.instructure.com/api/v1/courses/7272/modules\" data-api-returntype=\"[Module]\"><strong>Units</strong></a> is the place for information about this module and all your learning content.</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"padboxwhite\" class=\"pad-box-mini border border-trbl stirling_padding\">\n<p><i class=\"icon-Line icon-flag\"></i> <strong>Find support:</strong> Time at university can be exciting, but it can also feel stressful or overwhelming at times. If at any point during the year you feel like you\u2019re struggling or need support, please remember you are not alone. We are here to help. Please reach out to your <strong>Module Coordinator </strong>(via the Key Contacts page) or your <strong>Personal Tutor</strong>.</p>\n<p>Alternatively, <strong>navigate</strong> to '<a title=\"0.4 Key Support Routes\" href=\"https://buv.instructure.com/courses/7272/pages/0-dot-4-key-support-routes-2\" data-course-type=\"wikiPages\" data-published=\"true\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://buv.instructure.com/api/v1/courses/7272/pages/0-dot-4-key-support-routes-2\" data-api-returntype=\"Page\">Key Support Routes</a>' to find more sources of support available to you including the University's<span>&nbsp;</span><a class=\"inline_disabled\" title=\"Link\" href=\"https://www.stir.ac.uk/student-life/support-wellbeing/student-learning-services/\" target=\"_blank\">Student Learning Services</a><span>&nbsp;</span>and/or<span>&nbsp;</span><a class=\"inline_disabled\" href=\"https://www.stir.ac.uk/student-life/support-wellbeing/student-support-services/your-mental-health-and-wellbeing/\" target=\"_blank\">Mental Health and Wellbeing Service</a>.&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>"
